---
title: awscli overlay
---
<h1>Overlay awscli - AWS CLI utilities</h1>
<p>Supplies the AWS CLI.</p>
<p>If you find the help doesn't work, make sure you haven't got groff
installed (<code>zap uninstall groff</code>).</p>
<p>This overlay currently installs both the now <a href="https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/developer/cli-v1-maintenance-mode-announcement/">deprecated</a> v1 of
the AWS cli, and the newer v2 as the <code>aws2</code> command. Soon, v1
will be retired and v2 will become the default, and eventually only,
available version.</p>
<p>If you're after the python API, install the @boto overlay instead.</p>
